    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) This Part is not intended to limit or exclude the operation of a law of a Territory relating to:  (a) the search of premises; or  (b) arrest and related matters; or  (c) the stopping, detaining or searching of conveyances or persons; or  (d) the seizure of things; or  (e) the requesting of information or documents from persons; in relation to offences against a law of that Territory." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

