    cml:premiseText "(3A) The thing may be moved..." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-3k-ss-3a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3K(3A) Use of equipment to examine or process things" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3A) The thing may be moved to another place for examination or processing for no longer than whichever of the following is applicable:  (a) if the thing is a computer or data storage device—30 days;  (b) otherwise—14 days." ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3k-ss-3b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3K(3B) Use of equipment to examine or process things"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3k-ss-3b ;
    values:originalText "(3B) An executing officer may apply to an issuing officer for one or more extensions of that time if the executing officer believes on reasonable grounds that the thing cannot be examined or processed within the time applicable under subsection (3A) or that time as previously extended.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)" ;
    skos:definition "(3B) An executing officer may apply to an issuing officer for one or more extensions of that time if the executing officer believes on reasonable grounds that the thing cannot be examined or processed within the time applicable under subsection (3A) or that time as previously extended.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "540b634356f503bdd273c222645737ccdf8a1f1b4b695b7dc5434b89b468ebce" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3k ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Executing officer may request extension of time for examination or processing." ;
