concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3sa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3SA Relationship of this Division to parliamentary privileges and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3sa ;
    values:originalText "immunities  To avoid doubt, this Division does not affect the law relating to the powers, privileges and immunities of any of the following:  (a) each House of the Parliament;  (b) the members of each House of the Parliament;  (c) the committees of each House of the Parliament and joint committees of both Houses of the Parliament.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)" ;
    skos:definition "immunities  To avoid doubt, this Division does not affect the law relating to the powers, privileges and immunities of any of the following:  (a) each House of the Parliament;  (b) the members of each House of the Parliament;  (c) the committees of each House of the Parliament and joint committees of both Houses of the Parliament.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a0f4d1d938a455d4a2da313e8e679ea056cd9edb21566fa3e0b8aefceb10a0ae" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts certain parliamentary powers and immunities from this Division." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
