doc:sec-3ue-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3UE(5) Seizure of terrorism related items and serious offence related" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) In the course of searching for the thing, the police officer may also seize any other thing, or do anything to make the premises safe, if the police officer suspects, on reasonable grounds, that it is necessary to do so:  (a) in order to protect a person’s life, health or safety; and  (b) without the authority of a search warrant because the circumstances are serious and urgent." ;
