concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ue-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3UE(6) Seizure of terrorism related items and serious offence related"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3ue-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) In exercising powers under this section:  (a) the police officer may use such assistance; and  (b) the police officer, or a person who is also a police officer and who is assisting the police officer, may use such force against persons and things; and  (c) a person (other than a police officer) who is authorised by the police officer to assist the police officer may use such force against things; as is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances. Notification" ;
    skos:definition "(6) In exercising powers under this section:  (a) the police officer may use such assistance; and  (b) the police officer, or a person who is also a police officer and who is assisting the police officer, may use such force against persons and things; and  (c) a person (other than a police officer) who is authorised by the police officer to assist the police officer may use such force against things; as is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances. Notification"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "86865ee46ed1c4534b02edc964522c56d6b3b214a74688a484e307475e8156b1" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ue ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Police officer may use assistance and force against persons and things." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
