concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3UH Relationship of Subdivision to other laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3uh ;
    values:originalText "(1) The powers conferred, and duties imposed, by this Subdivision on police officers are in addition to, and not in derogation of, any other powers conferred, or duties imposed, by any other law of the Commonwealth or the law of a State or Territory.  (2) This Division is not intended to exclude or limit the operation of any other law of the Commonwealth or the law of a State or Territory in so far as it is capable of operating concurrently with this Subdivision. Subdivision C—Prescribed security zones" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The powers conferred, and duties imposed, by this Subdivision on police officers are in addition to, and not in derogation of, any other powers conferred, or duties imposed, by any other law of the Commonwealth or the law of a State or Territory.  (2) This Division is not intended to exclude or limit the operation of any other law of the Commonwealth or the law of a State or Territory in so far as it is capable of operating concurrently with this Subdivision. Subdivision C—Prescribed security zones"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "80a75284eff20de4f627c7336d499ebb62da16a7436ec3d25194d250205829d8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uh-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uh-ss-2 ;
