doc:sec-3uj-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3UJ(3) Minister may make declarations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A declaration ceases to have effect:  (a) at the end of 28 days after it is made; or  (b) if a shorter period is specified in the declaration—at the end of the shorter period; unless the declaration is revoked by the Minister before then. Revocation of declaration" ;
