concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 December 2026."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA Powers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A  Section 3UK  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A declaration under section 3UJ that is in force at the end of 7 December 2026 ceases to be in force at that time.  (3) A police officer cannot apply for, and the Minister cannot make, a declaration under section 3UJ after 7 December 2026.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)" ;
    skos:definition "Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA Powers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A  Section 3UK  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A declaration under section 3UJ that is in force at the end of 7 December 2026 ceases to be in force at that time.  (3) A police officer cannot apply for, and the Minister cannot make, a declaration under section 3UJ after 7 December 2026.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bebee64f1a939bd208628946d487195ce6ab9e590aa7c9b0b92769e986b986c2" ;
