concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uo-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3UO(3) Determination of airports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3uo-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) This Division applies in relation to an airport determined under subsection (1) only if the airport is ordinarily used for the purposes of any of the following:  (a) flights that start or end in a Territory;  (b) flights between Australia and a foreign country in which aircraft are used in the course of trade or commerce, for the carriage of passengers;  (c) flights between one State and another State in which aircraft are used in the course of trade or commerce, for the carriage of passengers." ;
    skos:definition "(3) This Division applies in relation to an airport determined under subsection (1) only if the airport is ordinarily used for the purposes of any of the following:  (a) flights that start or end in a Territory;  (b) flights between Australia and a foreign country in which aircraft are used in the course of trade or commerce, for the carriage of passengers;  (c) flights between one State and another State in which aircraft are used in the course of trade or commerce, for the carriage of passengers."@en ;
