concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uo-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3UO(4) Determination of airports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3uo-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) This Division may apply in relation to an airport determined under subsection (1) even if the airport is also used for a purpose other than a purpose mentioned in subsection (3). Note: See also section 3UR (move-on directions at airports—alternative constitutional scope).   Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA Identity information requirements, and move-on powers, at airports  Division 3B  Section 3UP  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) This Division may apply in relation to an airport determined under subsection (1) even if the airport is also used for a purpose other than a purpose mentioned in subsection (3). Note: See also section 3UR (move-on directions at airports—alternative constitutional scope).   Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA Identity information requirements, and move-on powers, at airports  Division 3B  Section 3UP  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
