concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ur a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3UR Move-on directions at airports—alternative constitutional"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3ur ;
    values:originalText "scope  Without limiting its effect apart from this section, section 3UQ also has the effect it would have if the definition of major airport in section 3UM did not include an airport determined by the Minister under section 3UO." ;
    skos:definition "scope  Without limiting its effect apart from this section, section 3UQ also has the effect it would have if the definition of major airport in section 3UM did not include an airport determined by the Minister under section 3UO."@en ;
