doc:sec-3zh-ss-2b a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3ZH(2B) Power to conduct an ordinary search or a strip search" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2B) The conducting of a strip search may include taking photographs of evidential material found on the person, whether or not taking photographs is a forensic procedure provided for by Part ID.   Part IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under delayed notification search warrants)" ;
