concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3ZL(3A) Offence of refusing to allow identification material to be taken"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3zl-ss-3a ;
    values:originalText "(3A) The judge or magistrate may also make any other orders that are reasonably necessary for ensuring that the impressions of the person’s fingerprints and/or a photograph of the person are taken in accordance with the order under subsection (1). For example, the judge or magistrate may order the person to attend a specified police station at a specified time." ;
    skos:definition "(3A) The judge or magistrate may also make any other orders that are reasonably necessary for ensuring that the impressions of the person’s fingerprints and/or a photograph of the person are taken in accordance with the order under subsection (1). For example, the judge or magistrate may order the person to attend a specified police station at a specified time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0db589c5403748a09da62f6cfbbc0cc69e6aec16daa59c99c227b2c71f70ddf4" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl ;
    cof:pageNumber "124"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Judge or magistrate may order person to attend police station." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.124" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a-norm .
