concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-4h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4H Summary offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4h ;
    values:originalText "Offences against a law of the Commonwealth, being offences which:  (a) are punishable by imprisonment for a period not exceeding 12 months; or  (b) are not punishable by imprisonment; are summary offences, unless the contrary intention appears." ;
    skos:definition "Offences against a law of the Commonwealth, being offences which:  (a) are punishable by imprisonment for a period not exceeding 12 months; or  (b) are not punishable by imprisonment; are summary offences, unless the contrary intention appears."@en ;
