doc:sec-4ja-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4JA(1) Some indictable offences punishable by fine only may be dealt" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A court of summary jurisdiction may hear and determine an indictable offence if:  (a) the offence is not punishable by imprisonment; and  (b) the pecuniary penalty for the offence is not more than 600 penalty units for an individual or 3,000 penalty units for a body corporate; and  (c) the defendant and prosecution consent." ;
    cof:pageNumber "335"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-4ja-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4JA(2) Some indictable offences punishable by fine only may be dealt"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4ja-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the defendant is convicted, the court may impose a pecuniary penalty of:  (a) not more than 60 penalty units for an individual or 300 penalty units for a body corporate if the offence would be punishable on indictment by a pecuniary penalty of not more than 300 penalty units for an individual or 1,500 penalty units for a body corporate; or  (b) not more than 120 penalty units for an individual or 600 penalty units for a body corporate if the offence would be punishable on indictment by a pecuniary penalty of not more than 600 penalty units for an individual or 3,000 penalty units for a body corporate. However, the court may not impose a pecuniary penalty greater than the penalty that could have been imposed if the offence had been prosecuted on indictment." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the defendant is convicted, the court may impose a pecuniary penalty of:  (a) not more than 60 penalty units for an individual or 300 penalty units for a body corporate if the offence would be punishable on indictment by a pecuniary penalty of not more than 300 penalty units for an individual or 1,500 penalty units for a body corporate; or  (b) not more than 120 penalty units for an individual or 600 penalty units for a body corporate if the offence would be punishable on indictment by a pecuniary penalty of not more than 600 penalty units for an individual or 3,000 penalty units for a body corporate. However, the court may not impose a pecuniary penalty greater than the penalty that could have been imposed if the offence had been prosecuted on indictment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "97d0863346009ab597c5313dfe27b64f1feef77ef62e780388958737efe6a892" ;
