concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ab-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15AB(3) Matters to be considered in certain bail applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15ab-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In paragraph (1)(b): criminal behaviour includes:  (a) any conduct, omission to act, circumstance or result that is, or forms part of, a physical element of the offence in question; and  (b) any fault element relating to such a physical element.   General  Part IA  Section 15AB  Crimes Act 1914  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
