doc:sec-15b-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15B(1A) Time for commencement of prosecutions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) A prosecution of a body corporate for an offence against any law of the Commonwealth may be commenced as follows:  (a) if the maximum penalty which may be imposed for the offence in respect of a body corporate is, or includes, a fine of more than 150 penalty units in the case of a first conviction—at any time;  (b) in any other case—at any time within one year after the commission of the offence." ;
    cof:pageNumber "351"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15b-ss-1b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15B(1B) Time for commencement of prosecutions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-15b-ss-1b ;
    values:originalText "(1B) A prosecution of an individual for an offence that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code, or against another law of the Commonwealth dealing with aiding and abetting, in relation to an offence committed by a body corporate may be commenced as follows:  (a) if the maximum penalty which may be imposed for the principal offence in respect of a body corporate is, or includes, a fine of more than 150 penalty units in the case of a first conviction—at any time;  (b) in any other case—at any time within one year after the commission of the offence by the individual." ;
    skos:definition "(1B) A prosecution of an individual for an offence that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code, or against another law of the Commonwealth dealing with aiding and abetting, in relation to an offence committed by a body corporate may be commenced as follows:  (a) if the maximum penalty which may be imposed for the principal offence in respect of a body corporate is, or includes, a fine of more than 150 penalty units in the case of a first conviction—at any time;  (b) in any other case—at any time within one year after the commission of the offence by the individual."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c30950083b1eca2d235c0d2bbea5d2d50bbe0b5df10d93a7dae6f93885596c1c" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15b ;
    cof:pageNumber "351"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prosecution timing restrictions" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-act-1914.pdf> ;
